From df45b200c8cdf008b8cbd487b1769c20bbd23557 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: u <u@example.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 10:01:30 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 05/27] arm64: commdlg/ddeml/lzexpand/mm headers: fix pointer
 conversions, mmddk conflicts, critsect init

---
 commdlg/filedlg.c        |  4 ++--
 commdlg/finddlg.c        | 10 +++++-----
 commdlg/printdlg.c       |  8 +++++---
